      "id": 3700241,
      "name": "Model: Starlight Rider Faceplate",
      "desc": "A unique and interesting collectible that can be displayed in your room.",
      "desc2": "A limited-edition toy crafted to mimic a W-Engine.\n\nWhat is a knight?\nThe crimson knight says, \"Carrying out the justice in my heart!\" The amber knight says, \"Dealing with each sin in this world!\" The verdant knight says, \"Protecting everyone's hope!\"\nSo what is a knight, in the end? The advanced tactical construct suddenly falls into serious thought over this profound question, no different from the philosophers who have long pondered the ultimate meaning of existence.\nRegrettably, this great and noble meditation on chivalric aesthetics is cut short in under ten seconds by an unceremonious interruption from a companion.\n\"Billy, you've watched 'Starlight Knight: A Knight's Proof' a hundred times already. So what even is the proof?\"\n\"I'll know when I've watched it another hundred times!\"\n—At the Cunning Hares' place, two people arguing over the remote.",
